      "原文": "The main types of energy consumed by the Company include gasoline, diesel, and electricity, with no consumption of natural gas, steam, coal, or liquefied petroleum gas. Total Energy Consumption tce 3,691.02; Total Energy Consumption per Unit Output tce/10,000 Units 4.31"
